<title>USA: First Charter to take $1.6-$2.2mln charge.</title>
<headline>First Charter to take $1.6-$2.2mln charge.</headline>
<dateline>CONCORD, N.C. 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Charter Corp said Friday it would take one-time after-tax charges totalling $1.6 million to $2.2 million for its planned acquisition of Carolina State Bank.</p>
<p>The bank said the charges include an estimated $150,000 to $200,000 provision for loan losses to conform Carolina's credit risk practices to First Charter's.</p>
</text>
